//! Real EmuTOS desktop drive ICONBLK bitmaps (32×32, 1bpp + mask),
//! extracted from `references/emutos/desk/icon.rsc` (icons [0] hard
//! disk, [1] floppy disk). Generated; do not edit by hand.
//!
//! Render convention: where MASK bit = 1 the icon is opaque — draw
//! DATA bit ? black : white; where MASK = 0 the desktop shows through.

